# Commit as: schwab-bridge/.dockerignore
#
# The bridge image only ever COPYs requirements.txt, so this is mostly belt and
# braces — but it guarantees no credential can reach an image layer even if the
# Dockerfile is edited later to copy source in.

.git
.githooks

# Secrets and live state. Bind-mounted at runtime, never built in.
.env
.env.*
credentials.env
token.json
.auth_state.json
reauth_inbox
task_inbox
data

.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc

README.md
SECURITY.md
LICENSE.md
